 {:name "turn-component-membership-into-interior-membership-via-openness"
  :lane :arc-lane
  :level :tactic
  :status :draft
  :body
  {:scope
   {:language :lean4
    :context
    "After unfolding `frontier`, the contradiction requires that a point in an open connected component belongs to its interior, but the available fact is only ordinary membership."}
   :before
   "Try to use component membership directly as membership in `interior (connectedComponentIn U x)`."
   :after
   "Prove `hcomponentOpen : IsOpen (connectedComponentIn U x) := hU.connectedComponentIn`, then rewrite with `hcomponentOpen.interior_eq` before destructuring frontier membership."
